<section class="page-heading reveal"><div><p class="kicker">ABOUT THE SYSTEM</p><h1>Form follows function.</h1><p>CasaForma translates Bauhaus clarity into a complete, secure furniture showroom workflow.</p></div></section>
<section class="about-grid">
    <article class="about-card red reveal"><span>01</span><h2>Purpose</h2><p>Manage furniture, clients, staff, inventory, and sales through one coherent CodeIgniter application.</p></article>
    <article class="about-card blue reveal"><span>02</span><h2>Architecture</h2><p>Routes, protected controllers, models, relational data, validated forms, cloud media, and responsive views remain separated through MVC.</p></article>
    <article class="about-card yellow reveal"><span>03</span><h2>Security</h2><p>Passwords are hashed, routes are filtered, CSRF is enabled, output is escaped, and every sale is verified on the server.</p></article>
    <article class="about-card green reveal"><span>04</span><h2>Inventory integrity</h2><p>Sales run inside database transactions, prevent overselling, and reduce available stock only after successful validation.</p></article>
</section>